<p>Surround yourself with natural forces, ignoring <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10%, 23%, 31%, 38%, 43%</acronym> acid resistance of your targets.</p><p>In addition, the acid will nourish your bloated oozes, giving them an additional <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">44, 59, 70, 80, 89</acronym> life regeneration per turn.</p>